You can ID Cancellation because it will clear most potions, turn booze
into fruit juice (I think), blank scrolls and remove
charges/enchantment from other items.  If you have a worthless but
already identified scroll, you can drop it in front of a monster, move
one square over, and zap.  If it's teleportation, they'll both
disappear.  If it's make invisible, only the monster will disappear. 
If it's cancellation, neither will disappear and you will have a nice,
blank scroll (so preferably use it only on Fire, Punishment, Amnesia,
etc.)


