However, if there didn't happen to be an unknown secret door in the
room where you were testing your wands (with the chest, door, lichen
corpse, and live monster) then you can still differentiate between
Nothing and Secret Door Detection because the former asks for a
direction, while the latter does not.  If you line up your targets and
zap the wand and it doesn't bother asking for a direction, it's SDD. 
If it asks for a direction but doesn't seem to do anything, it's
Nothing.

 
